Package: GCMSbenchmark
Type: Package
Title: Compare GC/MS Chromatogram Deconvolution Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tom", "Wenseleers", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tom.wenseleers@kuleuven.be")
Description: Runs local gas chromatography mass spectrometry deconvolution
    backends, standardizes their peak, spectrum and elution profile exports,
    and scores compound recovery against optional simulated truth.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: clue, methods, processx, stats, tools, utils
Suggests: BiocParallel, CAMERA, GCMSprime, erah, future, logconNMF, mzR, ncdf4,
    xcms
